** Abaqus material card - Red Lipstick 210D
** Source: tspa-fabric-materials (Zournatzis et al.), uniaxial tests ISO 527-1/-3, n=3 per direction
** Units: MPa, mm (consistent N-mm-s system)
** Orthotropic in-plane (membrane/shell) model; direction 1 = warp, 2 = weft
** E1 = 456.9 MPa (warp, measured), E2 = 233.7 MPa (weft), E45 = 147.8 MPa (bias, measured)
** nu12 = 0.3 (ASSUMED, not measured)
** G12 derived from the bias modulus: 1/G12 = 4/E45 - 1/E1 - 1/E2 + 2*nu12/E1  (depends on assumed nu12)
** G13 = G23 = G12 (ASSUMED; transverse shear irrelevant for membrane models)
** Linear-elastic response observed up to near failure. Strength (MPa): warp 105.4, weft 70.6, bias 98.2
** Nominal thickness: 0.360 mm
*MATERIAL, NAME=RED_LIPSTICK_210D
*ELASTIC, TYPE=LAMINA
